  "notes":"Manifest v44 adds native-first mobile scroll gesture ownership. During an active touch drag and the short inertial handoff after release, Chat suppresses the stream-follow scroll re-lock that previously fought the user's finger and made scrolling feel delayed. The transcript uses native pan-y, momentum scrolling, contained overscroll and auto scroll behavior, while the existing stream-follow system may resume only after the gesture/momentum window settles. Companion first-paint, activity/identity/response composition, Google identity, account/theme settings, wallpaper ownership, turn integrity, transcript continuity and context capacity remain preserved."
